    "description": {
      "value": "These panpipes are made of what seems to be beat-up tin bound by frayed leather and look like they shouldn't function at all, but in skilled hands they emit a beautiful sound that beguiles the senses. While playing the pipes, you gain a +1 item bonus to Diplomacy and Performance checks.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- - **2nd:** hideous laughter, touch of idiocy\n- - **3rd:** charm, hypnotic pattern, mind reading, zone of truth"
